{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01911","headline":"杂曲歌辞 夜寒吟 · 鲍溶","name":"杂曲歌辞 夜寒吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九衢金吾夜行行，上宫玉漏遥分明。\n霜飙乘阴扫地起，旅鸿迷雪绕枕声。\n远人归梦既不成，留家惜夜欢心发。\n罗幕画堂深皎洁，兰烟对酒客几人。\n兽火扬光二三月，细腰楚姬丝竹间。\n白紵长袖歌闲闲，岂识苦寒损朱颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}